The raw layer of the **{{SUBJECT}}** wiki. Every source lands here: files are attached to this note, and every source — attached file or separate `source`-tagged note — gets a row in the ledger below. Sources are immutable once landed; the wiki ([[Index]]) is built *from* them, never the other way.

File refs like `[[file:name.pdf]]` resolve only on this note, because the files are attached here. Wiki pages cite sources by name with a link back to this note.

